Every ICPC directory of tests is a group named by its path under data/,
at any depth. A test without .ans is answered by the main solution.

-- problem.yaml --
name: Groups
validation: custom
-- data/sample/1.in --
1
-- data/sample/1.ans --
1
-- data/secret/group1/a.in --
2
-- data/secret/group1/a.ans --
2
-- data/secret/group2/nested/c.in --
4
-- output_validators/checker/checker.cpp --
int main() {}
